        "@value": "by inserting after paragraph (e) the following paragraph: “ (ea) one Consultant Quantity Surveyor or Professional Quantity Surveyor from the private sector who is not practising as a consulting Quantity Surveyor, on the nomination of the Royal Institution of Surveyors Malaysia or any other professional body recognized by the Board to represent Quantity Surveyors in the private sector;”; and"
